# OPIc Sample Answer — Day40

## Giving Advice

> Oh, that's really unfortunate. If I were in your position, I would contact the seller first and explain what happened. I would also take some pictures of the damaged product as proof. The seller might be able to send you a replacement or give you a refund. If they don't respond, I would contact the delivery company and ask them what I should do. Another option would be to request a refund through the shopping website. I think the most important thing is to contact the seller as soon as possible.

---

## Useful Structure

> **That's really unfortunate.**
> → 공감

> **If I were in your position, I would...**
> → 핵심 조언

> **The reason is that...**
> → 이유

> **If that doesn't work,...**
> → 대안

> **I think the most important thing is...**
> → 마무리

### 오늘의 핵심 문장

> **If I were in your position, I would contact the seller first.**
